sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Account holder
    actor A as Operations/Admin
    participant Client as Web or mobile app
    participant API as API and access policy
    participant DB as Users, roles and device/session records
    U->>Client: Enter assigned login and password
    Client->>API: Submit login
    API->>DB: Verify account, credentials and role
    alt Eligible account
        API-->>Client: Authorized token and workspace
        opt Household device has no selected member
            U->>Client: Select household device owner
            Client->>API: Validate selection and bind permitted session
        end
        opt Authorized personnel maintenance
            A->>API: Create/update personnel, team or access settings
            API->>DB: Enforce management rights and save changes
        end
    else Invalid, inactive or unauthorized account
        API-->>Client: Reject without granting access
    end
    opt Password recovery
        U->>API: Follow configured recovery verification
        API->>DB: Verify recovery information and update password
        Note over U,DB: Recovery differs by account type, verify current implementation
    end
    U->>Client: Sign out
    Client->>API: Best-effort token revocation
    Client->>Client: Clear local token and cached account snapshots
